# Kutzil, Malamet Exemplar: Pest Mascot (2/3 trample) grows a +1/+1 counter (3/4: power above its base 2) when Dissection
# Practice gains Bot1 a life. It attacks with a Memnite (power 1, its base: never qualifies) and is blocked by Scuzzback
# Scrapper (1/1 wither). The Mascot assigns 1 to the Scrapper and tramples 2 over (CR 702.19b); the Scrapper's wither damage
# puts a -1/-1 counter on it as part of the same event (CR 702.80a), so right after the damage - when the trigger is checked,
# before state-based actions cancel the counters (CR 603.10, 704.5q) - its power is 2, equal to its base. Neither creature
# that dealt damage to Bot2 has power above base, so Bot1 draws nothing: the hand is the turn-5 draw alone (Island).

